W_AMIGA_TONE_HINT:["只對 Amiga 系的 MOD 模組（ProTracker／Soundtracker／Noisetracker 與 ProWizard 壓縮包）：用 Paula 模擬器（BLEP）重現硬體的聲音。A500 帶 A500 的固定濾波，LED 濾波照模組的指令開關；A500 + LED 是 LED 濾波一直開（更悶）；A1200 沒有類比濾波（更亮，LED 指令無效）。耗用處理器較多：最重的 4 聲道模組約佔音訊核心 55 %（螢幕開著量的）；六、八聲道的模組不套用，聲音照舊；改了之後播放中的模組下一個區塊就換","只对 Amiga 系的 MOD 模块（ProTracker／Soundtracker／Noisetracker 与 ProWizard 压缩包）：用 Paula 模拟器（BLEP）重现硬件的声音。A500 带 A500 的固定滤波，LED 滤波按模块的指令开关；A500 + LED 是 LED 滤波一直开（更闷）；A1200 没有模拟滤波（更亮，LED 指令无效）。占用处理器较多：最重的 4 声道模块约占音频核心 55 %（屏幕开着量的）；六、八声道的模块不套用，声音照旧；改了之后播放中的模块下一个区块就换","Only for Amiga-family MOD modules (ProTracker / Soundtracker / Noisetracker and ProWizard packs): the Paula simulator (BLEP) recreates the hardware sound. A500 has the A500's fixed filter, with the LED filter following the module's command; A500 + LED keeps the LED filter always on (duller); A1200 has no analogue filter (brighter, the LED command is ignored). It costs more CPU: the heaviest 4-channel module takes about 55 % of the audio core (measured with the screen on); 6- and 8-channel modules are not touched and sound as before. A playing module switches within one block"],
