W_FLASH_BOARD_ROUND_DESC:["圓形螢幕 360×360、一個旋鈕","圆形屏幕 360×360、一个旋钮","round 360×360 screen, one knob"],
W_FLASH_BOOT_HINT:["連不上時：按住本機的 BOOT 針孔再插上 USB 線（進下載模式，需要你在場），然後再按「連線並檢查」。圓形板的針孔在 USB-C 旁邊；FakePod 沒有針孔：兩個鍵同時按住再開機（或插上 USB）。","连不上时：按住本机的 BOOT 针孔再插上 USB 线（进入下载模式，需要你在场），然后再按“连接并检查”。圆形板的针孔在 USB-C 旁边；FakePod 没有针孔：两个键同时按住再开机（或插上 USB）。","If it cannot connect: hold the BOOT pinhole on the player while plugging in the USB cable (download mode; you need to be there), then press \"Connect and check\" again. On the round board the pin-hole is beside the USB-C; the FakePod has none: hold both keys while powering on (or plugging in USB)."],
W_FLASH_CANCELLED:["已取消，序列埠已放開。","已取消，串口已释放。","Cancelled; the serial port is released."],
W_FLASH_CARD_INFO:["TF 卡內容包 jukedial-VERSION-card.zip 也在同一個 Releases 頁面（資料夾骨架、設定範本、HUD 錶面、字型、白噪音包）。下載後解壓縮到 TF 卡根目錄；同名的設定檔會被覆蓋，改過的請先備份。","TF 卡内容包 jukedial-VERSION-card.zip 也在同一个 Releases 页面（文件夹骨架、设置模板、HUD 表盘、字体、白噪音包）。下载后解压缩到 TF 卡根目录；同名的设置文件会被覆盖，改过的请先备份。","The TF card content pack jukedial-VERSION-card.zip is on the same Releases page (folder skeleton, settings template, HUD faces, fonts, noise pack). Unzip it to the card root; settings files with the same name are overwritten, back up edited ones first."],
W_FLASH_CARD_TITLE:["TF 卡內容包","TF 卡内容包","TF card content pack"],
