W_FLASH_FILE_INFO:["到專案的 Releases 頁面下載你這塊板子的檔案：jukedial-VERSION-round.bin（圓形板）或 jukedial-VERSION-fakepod.bin（FakePod）。檔案只在你的瀏覽器裡讀取與檢查，不會上傳到任何地方。","到项目的 Releases 页面下载你这块板子的文件：jukedial-VERSION-round.bin（圆形板）或 jukedial-VERSION-fakepod.bin（FakePod）。文件只在你的浏览器里读取和检查，不会上传到任何地方。","Download the file for your board from the project's Releases page: jukedial-VERSION-round.bin (round board) or jukedial-VERSION-fakepod.bin (FakePod). The file is only read and checked inside your browser; nothing is uploaded anywhere."],
